How to test the zoran driver:
- RAW capture
	mplayer tv:///dev/video0 -tv driver=v4l2

- MJPEG capture (compression)
	mplayer tv:///dev/video0 -tv driver=v4l2:outfmt=mjpeg
	TODO: need two test for both Dcim path

